Package: SEFT
Type: Package
Title: Spatial E-Value False Discovery Rate Testing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Anonymous", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "anonymous@example.invalid")
Description: Provides a compact implementation of spatial e-value false discovery
    rate testing for region-level inference from three-dimensional statistical
    maps. The package includes the covariate-adaptive and Ising working models,
    partial-conjunction testing, NIfTI input and output, and regional displays.
    Bundled AAL3 atlas files are third-party material under the GNU GPL.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    RNifti,
    stats,
    utils
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    waveslim
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
